  "id": "ftt",
  "term": "FTT",
  "definition": "FTT stands for Feeling Thinking Talking, a teacher training program for preschool and kindergarten classrooms that helps teachers support children’s language and emotion talk during everyday interactions. It is intended to strengthen young children’s emotion knowledge by improving how teachers discuss feelings with them.",
